docs {
  # Delete Test Case File (Soft-delete)

  Soft-deletes a file attachment. The physical file is preserved on disk for potential
  recovery. Requires `test_case_file:delete` permission and Contributor (or higher) role.
  Contributors can only delete files they uploaded.

  - `204 No Content` — deleted
  - `403 Forbidden` — missing permission, Viewer role, or Contributor ownership restriction
  - `404 Not Found` — project, test case, or file not found or already soft-deleted
}
